@startuml 궁합요청_생성

autonumber

actor User as Reader
participant BoardUI as B
participant "CompatibilityController\n(Flask API)" as CC
participant "CompatibilityService" as CS
database DB

Reader -> B: "작성자와 궁합 요청" 클릭
B -> CC: POST /api/v1/compatibility/requests {target_id, post_id}
CC -> CS: create_request(requester_id, target_id, post_id)
CS -> DB: SELECT pending WHERE requester_id,target_id
alt 중복 존재
  DB --> CS: existing
  CS --> CC: 409 Conflict
  CC --> B: 409
  B --> Reader: 이미 요청됨 안내
else 없음
  DB --> CS: none
  CS -> DB: INSERT compatibility_request(status='pending')
  DB --> CS: ok
  CS --> CC: 201 {request_id, status}
  CC --> B: 201 Created
  B --> Reader: 요청 완료
end

@enduml


